  "body": "Currently the spec asserts that [a `<nav>` element is a section with navigation links](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/sections.html#the-nav-element). I think things need to be changed nowadays. Please consider broadening `<nav>`'s semantics, so that it will be suitable as an application-like navigator within a single page.",
